      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Tears are women's final weapon, a shield against men. Rani, you tried hurling the Agni-astra; now you have come to the Varuna-astra. Unless you hurl the Mohana-astra, you cannot conquer the prince.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The Agni/Varuna/Mohana weapon sequence is transliterated as `-astra` to preserve the source's mythic metaphor and fire/water/charm progression."
        ]
